  "title": "The 4 One-Word ChatGPT Commands That Will Change How You Study",
  "description": "Type cheat sheet, blueprint, flashcards or mind map plus any topic and ChatGPT returns a one-page summary, a full system breakdown, a stack of study-ready cards, or a visual map of how everything connects. Four completely different ways to learn any subject, plus the exact wording that makes each one dramatically better and how to import the flashcards straight into Anki or Quizlet.\n\nGet the full command list here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NUBY8B7qyxGWalZCelkUl9kFo9fk0mkgqOu55BLMJeI/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #ChatGPT #StudyTips",
